re it lacked a source, it consistently declined to claim — the environment-variable leak argument, the PodSecurityPolicy version, the scanner names, the CVE format. Sixteen AUTHOR-REVIEW comments in the draft are the record of that discipline, not a defect count. Most of what I have flagged is ledger and register drift catching up to a chapter that got the hard calls right.","ttft_ms":15197,"type":"result","duration_ms":1056769,"uuid":"ccceaaa8-31ba-4133-9935-59e21b1d240d","ttft_stream_ms":7988,"time_to_request_ms":54,"queued_turn_count":0}
